    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present to the market 57 Kenilworth Square. A distinctive detached double fronted Victorian residence c. 3498 sq.ft  325 sq.m. Presently home/income and ideally suited continued use as same or restoration to full family residence.\r\n\r\nAs one of only 5 detached homes of similar styles on the South side on The Square, it is arguably the one with the best setting of all, with a spectacular view looking right down the full length of Kenilworth Square East with secluded gardens south facing to rear with side access. \r\n\r\nCarefully maintained throughout with high floor to ceiling heights, full of natural light with dual aspect in reception rooms.\r\n\r\nEnviable location beside Rathgar and Rathmines Villages, a wide range of primary and secondary schools including Rathgar National and Junior schools, Kildare Place, High School, St Mary’s, Alexandra College etc.\r\n\r\nThe property is beside bus routes, parks, sports facilities and within easy reach of the M50 and city centre.\r\n\r\nComprising at hall level reception hall, Inner hall with w.c whb, utility room, lounge with marble mantlepiece, dual aspect. There is a large open plan living/kitchen/dining with extensive range of units, dual aspect.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor are 4 bedrooms/ main ensuite and large family bathroom. At garden level are two apartments- one with living, kitchen, utility, bedroom, study, showerroom. The second has living/kitchen, bedroom, study, showerroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation \r\nHall level \r\n\r\nReception Hall \r\nOrnate ceiling cornice and centre rose. Arch to inner hall\r\n\r\nInner hall\r\nw.c, whb, tiled.\r\nUtility \r\nPlumbed for washing machine, shelving. 2 x central heating boilers. Steps to garden.\r\n\r\nLounge \r\nMarble mantlepiece, ceiling cornice, dual aspect.\r\n\r\nLiving/Kitchen/dining\r\nDual aspect, ceiling cornice, recessed lights, wolf gas and electric cooker with extractor. Range of units. Island unit with marble worktop, sink, fitted units. Fitted wall units with twin Earthenware sinks, marble worktops.\r\n\r\n1st floor \r\nBedroom 1 (rear)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front) \r\nCeiling cornice, walk-in-wardrobe, ensuite, shower, w.c, whb on glass base. Tiled. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) \r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBathroom \r\nStand alone bath. Rainfall and telephone shower, whb, w.c. Tiled, ceiling cornice, recessed lights, velux window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (rear)\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nStairs to study\r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nGarden level \r\n\r\nFlat 1 \r\n\r\nStudy \r\nRecessed lights.\r\n\r\nShowerroom \r\nMira shower, w.c, whb, tiled. \r\n\r\nLiving/dining \r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom \r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nFitted units, sink unit. Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nUtility \r\nDoors to rear\r\nFlat 2\r\n\r\nStudy \r\n\r\nLiving/Kitchen\r\nFitted units, sink unit, plumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nBedroom \r\nCeiling cornice, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nShowerroom\r\nMira shower, w.c, whb, tiled. \r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront garden in lawn. Side entrance. South facing rear garden and paved patio areas. Trees, hedging."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 3498 sq.ft  325 sq.m\r\nGFCH\r\nSouth facing to rear\r\nOpen aspect to front\r\nSide entrance \r\nBeside Rathgar and Rathmines Villages\r\nBeside schools, bus routes, sports facilities, parks.\r\nConvenient to M50 and city centre."
